Project: CrwdCtrl

CrwdCtrl is a community and event discovery platform where users can find college fests, running clubs, gym communities, meetups and student events.

Guidelines:
- Always prioritize clean, modular and reusable code.
- Use responsive layouts optimized for mobile and laptop screens.
- Avoid unnecessary refactoring unless required.
- When suggesting code changes, modify only the required files instead of rewriting the whole project.
- Prefer improving existing components rather than creating new duplicates.
- Maintain consistent UI spacing, modern card layouts and simple navigation.
